---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<p>
				Hi! I'm Benkang Peng. My research interests include compilers, 
				particularly AI compilers and compiler infrastructure such as LLVM and MLIR, 
				and I am currently conducting research in this field. 
				Previously, I worked on digital circuit design.
			</p>
			<p>
				I use this blog to share technical notes and things I've learned along the way.
			</p>
			<p>
				Feel free to reach out at <a href="mailto:benkangpeng@163.com">benkangpeng@163.com</a> if
				you'd like to connect or exchange ideas~
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
